        "ggAAgSqaB4m_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">10-20 lbs of muscle gained. Visible definition - shoulder, arms, chest. All-day energy that feels effortless. Bedroom performance that maker her very happy. You're not just 'bak' - you're better than before.</span></p>",
        "ggD9gzqCSS7_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FF2001;font-size:24px;\"><strong>Days 8-30</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#413C3C;font-size:24px;\"><strong>The Shift</strong></span></p>",
        "ggEpWZcMHdU_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FF2001;font-size:24px;\"><strong>Days 1-7</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#423C3C;font-size:24px;\"><strong>The Awakening</strong></span></p>",
        "ggeG_3rX_kA_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Morning wood returns. Mental fog clears. Subtle energy increase—less afternoon crash. Better sleep. Your body is receiving the signal to restart production. You're not imagining it.</span></p>",
        "gggRp_TgtPY_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Noticeable energy increase—no 3 PM crash. Libido returning with force. Strength gains accelerating. Muscle definition starting to show. Confidence rising. Your woman notices before you do.</span></p>",
        "ggpxNQgYhOu_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Natural restoration takes time. Your body didn't shut down overnight - it won't restart overnight either. But the changes are real, measurable, and permanent.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>",
        "ggtehcRE9cV_text": "<span style=\"color:#000000;font-size:28px;\"><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT:</strong></span><span style=\"color:#FF2001;font-size:28px;\"><strong> YOUR 90-DAY TRANSFORMATION</strong></span>",
        "gguwKA7d2Q9_background_desktop_videoHtml5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/92a407d4e0c94a288eb54cac18c387dc.mp4",
        "gguwKA7d2Q9_background_mobile_videoHtml5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/92a407d4e0c94a288eb54cac18c387dc.mp4",
        "ggxstFS_BXG_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FF2001;font-size:24px;\"><strong>Days 31-90</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#413C3C;font-size:24px;\"><strong>The New Normal</strong></span></p>"
      },
