    "gp_section_617039326895670251": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "8df72ac75230ca7cefa92327ed28d740e847e7a52a7c92c82d75d83bf248a83e_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg22hWSkI-Z_text": "<p>Yes, absolutely. In fact, men over 50 often experience the most dramatic benefits because testosterone naturally declines with age. Chad Bites is specifically formulated to help mature men restore youthful hormone levels naturally. Many of our most enthusiastic customers are in their 50s, 60s, and beyond, reporting renewed energy, vitality, and performance.</p>",
        "gg7KNETkKSn_text": "<p>Everything you need to know about Chad Bites</p>",
        "gg8DLA-xFnC_text": "<p>Each bottle contains 60 gummies, which is a full 30-day supply at the recommended dose of 2 gummies per day. This ensures you get consistent daily support for optimal testosterone production throughout the month.</p>",
        "gg9pjhN_IUv_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#D0D4DB;\"><strong>Absolutely. Chad Bites is formulated with clinically-studied, natural ingredients that support your body's own testosterone production. It's manufactured in FDA-registered, GMP-certified facilities with third-party testing for purity and potency. Unlike synthetic hormones or injections, our formula works with your body's natural processes. Always consult your healthcare provider if you have specific health concerns.</strong></span></p>",
        "ggDUTIpuOsh_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(15,18,17,0.5);color:rgb(209,213,219);font-size:18px;\">No cycling necessary. Unlike hormones or synthetic compounds, Chad Bites contains natural ingredients that support your body's own testosterone production without shutting down natural function. You can take it daily, year-round, without the need for breaks or post-cycle therapy.</span></p>",
        "ggHYGo4oUux_text": "<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong>Frequently Asked</strong></span><strong> </strong><span style=\"color:#FF2001;\"><strong>Questions</strong></span>",
        "ggLk_EenDjZ_text": "<p>The recommended dose is 2 gummies per day for optimal results. This dosage has been carefully formulated to provide effective testosterone support while staying within safe ranges. Taking more than the recommended amount won't necessarily accelerate results and isn't advised. Consistency at the proper dose is key.</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"color:#F9F9F9;\"><strong>How long until I see results?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"color:#F3F4F6;\"><strong>Is this safe?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_2": "<p>Will this show up on drug tests?</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_3": "<p>Can I take this with other supplements?</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_4": "<p>Why gummies instead of pills?</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_5": "<p>How many gummies are in each bottle?</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_6": "<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_7": "<p>Do I need to cycle this?</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_8": "<p>Can I take more than 2 gummies per day</p>",
        "ggTsnvUkoeG_childItem_9": "<p>Is this suitable for men over 50?&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggV2bgC4PMj_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">Most men notice improvements in energy and focus within the first 7-14 days. For physical changes like increased strength, better recovery, and body composition improvements, expect to see noticeable results within 4-6 weeks of consistent use. Optimal hormonal support builds over time, with peak benefits typically experienced at the 90-day mark.</span></p>",
        "ggm0DJbUuLC_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(15,18,17,0.5);color:rgb(209,213,219);font-size:18px;\">Gummies offer superior bioavailability because they begin absorption in the mouth through the mucous membranes. They're also more enjoyable to take, which means better compliance and consistency. Plus, you actually look forward to taking them instead of choking down horse pills. Taste matters when you're building a daily habit.</span></p>",
        "ggmS2GRz3Y1_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(15,18,17,0.5);color:rgb(209,213,219);font-size:18px;\">We stand behind our product with a 90-day money-back guarantee. If you don't feel a noticeable difference in your energy, focus, or performance, simply contact our team for a full refund. No questions asked, no hassle. We're confident you'll experience the benefits, but if not, you risk nothing.</span></p>",
        "ggopcQzgOGg_text": "<p>No. Chad Bites contains zero banned substances and will not trigger positive results on standard drug tests. All ingredients are natural, legal, and approved for use in professional and amateur athletics. Our formula supports natural testosterone production rather than introducing synthetic hormones.</p>",
        "ggtudH7oLFJ_text": "<p>Chad Bites is designed to work synergistically with other supplements. However, if you're taking prescription medications or have health conditions, consult your doctor first.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-617039326895670251"
    },
